      "message": "fix(core): preserve TLS record boundaries before Vision Direct refusal\n\nBound ciphertext reads and authenticated plaintext delivery so a coalesced raw inner TLS record cannot hide the preceding Vision command 2 behind an outer TLS bad-MAC error. Keep Direct ownership unavailable and retain all existing mature-peer assertions.\n\nAdd five deterministic real-TLS regressions for both read-ahead layers, authentication, EOF, cancellation and ownership. Preserve the first macOS/Windows CI failures and the exact local repair evidence.\n\nLocal validation: five workspace gates, 272 Rust tests plus one doctest, and four unchanged full-Xray cases passed. The original sandbox UDP-bind EPERM remains recorded separately. Exact committed CI is required after this push.",
